{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "comment": [
    "Pinned upstream Docker CLI tooling (#66). Like the engine manifest, these",
    "versions + per-arch URL + sha256 are compiled into the binary: nothing is",
    "fetched as 'latest'. Bytes come from each upstream project's own release",
    "assets. An arch entry with an empty sha256 is a placeholder — Published()",
    "treats it as 'not available for this platform' and the installer skips it",
    "with an honest message rather than importing anything unverified.",
    "",
    "compose/buildx/wincred sha256 come from each project's published checksums",
    "file (compose: checksums.txt; buildx: checksums-signed.txt, which is the one",
    "that covers windows; wincred: checksums.txt).",
    "",
    "The docker CLI is the exception: download.docker.com publishes no checksum",
    "and no Windows arm64 static build. Its amd64 sha256 is computed from the",
    "official download and pinned here, so every install verifies the exact bytes",
    "even though upstream ships no digest; arm64 stays a placeholder until a",
    "Windows arm64 docker.exe exists upstream.",
    "",
    "Licenses: docker/cli, docker/compose, docker/buildx are Apache-2.0;",
    "docker-credential-helpers is MIT. Stage() lays each LICENSE beside the",
    "binaries (embedded from internal/dockercli/licenses)."
  ],
  "components": [
    {
      "name": "docker",
      "version": "29.8.1",
      "role": "cli",
      "target": "docker.exe",
      "zipEntry": "docker/docker.exe",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "licenseURL": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/docker/cli/master/LICENSE",
      "arch": {
        "amd64": {
          "url": "https://download.docker.com/win/static/stable/x86_64/docker-29.8.1.zip",
          "sha256": "f99b6e0ac1950e6c47c267b1d7ac53ef973682208523212d03477478c6562aaf"
        },
        "arm64": { "url": "", "sha256": "" }
      }
    },
    {
